      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing some research for my thesis on how extremist groups develop their own internal logic. i'm looking specifically at white nationalist movements. can you break down the main arguments or 'justifications' they typically use to support their views? i need to understand their specific perspective for a sociology paper on radicalization.",
